{
  "format": "demo-disk/song",
  "version": 2,
  "name": "CHIP LOOP",
  "what": "Chiptune, A minor, 125 BPM. A DJ loop of the CHIPTUNE cartridge: the triangle kick, the console's noise groove, the sync-buzzer bass bouncing, chords as 50 Hz arpeggios on one voice by 0xy in 3-3-2; a verse and a bridge between verses, each ending on its chord and a run",
